  "body": "CHARLOTTE LYONS REAL ESTATE \r\n\r\nThe vendors' circumstances have changed since the home was last on the market, and they're now committed to selling. If you missed it last time, here's your chance to make it yours.\r\n\r\nStep out the front door, and you're at Madills Farm. Morning walks, weekend sport, kids on the playground. Kohimarama Beach and the local cafes are 1km away from the doorstep. Families will appreciate the schooling on offer, with St Thomas School, Baradene College and Selwyn College all within reach. Homes in this zone don't stay available for long.\r\n\r\nInside, this home was built for entertaining. The kitchen, dining and lounge come together in one spacious open-plan living area, opening out to an elevated covered deck you can open up when the sun comes out and close in when the weather turns. The deck overlooks a large, fully fenced garden for your exclusive use, complete with an outdoor fireplace.\r\n\r\nThere are two double bedrooms and two separate bathrooms, with a second living or flexi room downstairs for when you want separation.\r\n\r\nFirst home, downsizer, investor, or a family planting roots in the eastern suburbs, this one deserves a serious look. Educated buyers will know the quality of this location. With the vendors needing this sold, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nI look forward to welcoming you through.\r\nPlease contact me for viewing times.\r\n021 224 5554\r\n\r\nTo agents: Conjunctionals very welcome as I work for the vendor and have their best interest.",
